Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 07:46:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/8] Add RoboTwin mix200 joint-position normalizer stats

Exact per-dim stats of the action column over all 2,759,740 frames of
RoboTwin-mix200-aloha_agilex-joint (12,500 episodes), written by
tools/compute_robotwin_action_stats.py. action and state stats agree to
within 1e-2 (action[t] == state[t+1]). The base joints (dims 0 and 7) have
a thin tail past +-2 pi: 0.37% of frames normalize beyond |5| (115
episodes, max ~11), so the smoke test now checks the per-dim fraction
outside [-1, 1] instead of a hard max.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
